{"1751350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild Indigo Ranch", "steam_appid": 1751350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2560070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/4dd4e57be341b4c409255ee2269b2eff.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/4dd4e57be341b4c409255ee2269b2eff.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Howdy cowpoke! You have inherited Wild Indigo Ranch from your uncle, and a new life awaits you in the West! But the frontier isn’t always as idyllic as you hear in the stories. Grit Corp has sinister plans for turning the prairie into a profit-making machine. Work together with the townsfolk of nearby Tumbleville to right wrongs and restore Wild Indigo Ranch to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/d23a850412eff00cac12715710c2f1f0.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/d23a850412eff00cac12715710c2f1f0.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>For a prudent cowboy, resources need not be scarce on the prairie. Gather straw to craft a rope - now you can lasso your first Mustang, though you might want to start slow and catch Rosie the Donkey. A real buckaroo needs a six-shooter to serve justice and defend themself from local wildlife. If only you knew how to make one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/104efcb8c817367745591d6053652349.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/104efcb8c817367745591d6053652349.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>A cowpoke like you need a place to hang up your spurs after a long day of adventure. Pull up your sleeves, grab your tools, and get to work building the ranch of your dreams. Grow crops and farm the land, outfit your farm with stables, coops, and workshops. Finally, furnish and decorate your new home to your liking - home is where the hearth is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/72218bc16091f4c9c2b6ce6b2edab7a0.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/72218bc16091f4c9c2b6ce6b2edab7a0.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play as a lone ranger or team up with up to 3 friends. Work together to gather resources, build the finest ranch in the West, and ride together into the sunset.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/4dd4e57be341b4c409255ee2269b2eff.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/4dd4e57be341b4c409255ee2269b2eff.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Howdy cowpoke! You have inherited Wild Indigo Ranch from your uncle, and a new life awaits you in the West! But the frontier isn’t always as idyllic as you hear in the stories. Grit Corp has sinister plans for turning the prairie into a profit-making machine. Work together with the townsfolk of nearby Tumbleville to right wrongs and restore Wild Indigo Ranch to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/d23a850412eff00cac12715710c2f1f0.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/d23a850412eff00cac12715710c2f1f0.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>For a prudent cowboy, resources need not be scarce on the prairie. Gather straw to craft a rope - now you can lasso your first Mustang, though you might want to start slow and catch Rosie the Donkey. A real buckaroo needs a six-shooter to serve justice and defend themself from local wildlife. If only you knew how to make one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/104efcb8c817367745591d6053652349.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/104efcb8c817367745591d6053652349.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>A cowpoke like you need a place to hang up your spurs after a long day of adventure. Pull up your sleeves, grab your tools, and get to work building the ranch of your dreams. Grow crops and farm the land, outfit your farm with stables, coops, and workshops. Finally, furnish and decorate your new home to your liking - home is where the hearth is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/72218bc16091f4c9c2b6ce6b2edab7a0.poster.avif?t=1739869091\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/extras/72218bc16091f4c9c2b6ce6b2edab7a0.webm?t=1739869091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play as a lone ranger or team up with up to 3 friends. Work together to gather resources, build the finest ranch in the West, and ride together into the sunset.</p>", "short_description": "Wild Indigo Ranch is a cozy cowboy-life RPG for 1-4 players. Start a new life on the prairie, explore the frontier, build the finest ranch in the West, and ride into the sunset.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A fascinating blend of construction, exploration, resource management, and narrative”<br>Gamereactor<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/header_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1739869091", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/33f6d340c40bed56436089187f80224a0e5a9dc2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1739869091", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1751350/33f6d340c40bed56436089187f80224a0e5a9dc2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1739869091", "website": "https://www.fundaygames.dk/wildindigoranch", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": 